\[Theta]\[Omicron]\[Delta]\[Omicron]\[FinalSigma] NDSolve \[Delta]\:03af\[Nu]\
\[CurlyEpsilon]\[Iota] \[Alpha]\[Pi]\[Omicron]\[Tau]\[CurlyEpsilon]\[Lambda]\
\:03ad\[Sigma]\[Mu]\[Alpha]\[Tau]\[Alpha] \[Mu]\[CurlyEpsilon] \[Mu]\
\[CurlyEpsilon]\[Gamma]\:03ac\[Lambda]\[Eta] \[Alpha]\[Kappa]\[Rho]\:03af\
\[Beta]\[CurlyEpsilon]\[Iota]\[Alpha].\"\>"], "Print",
